flowchart TD
  C[Public surface change] --> O{Observable schema or semantics?}
  O -->|No| INTERNAL[Internal]
  O -->|Yes| B{Remove/rename/type/meaning/required/signature/error/fact change?}
  B -->|Yes| BREAK[Breaking: parallel V+1]
  B -->|No| E{Optional default or enum fallback fully proven?}
  E -->|Yes| COMP[Compatible]
  E -->|No| R{Within documented validation/freshness/timeout envelope?}
  R -->|Yes| COND[Conditional: affected consumers + Architecture approve]
  R -->|No| BREAK

